Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.47,0:00:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please stay safe, Rin, Shirou!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:49.29,0:01:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all you have?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:51.67,0:01:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,As I thought, you were a fake.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:54.20,0:01:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You are incapable of saving anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:56.80,0:02:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That shabby Archer said as much, did he not?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:00.40,0:02:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That your ideals were not your own.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:03.03,0:02:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm astonished that a man without a thing to call his own \Nwas arrogant enough to think he could accomplish anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:11.01,0:02:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,"Champion of justice"?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:13.23,0:02:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,"A world where no one is hurt"?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:15.67,0:02:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be absurd.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:18.04,0:02:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,"Humanity" is the name for beasts that cannot find joy in life without sacrifice.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:23.29,0:02:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Your much-vaunted "equality" is nonsense spouted \Nby weaklings who cannot bear to stare into the abyss.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:29.24,0:02:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It is naught but an excuse to cover up your own ugliness.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:33.85,0:02:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's exactly right.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.41,0:02:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My desires are borrowed.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:39.60,0:02:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,A pretense I put on, copied from someone I once saw saving another.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:45.60,0:02:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,When it happened, I was empty inside.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.20,0:02:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone was dying indiscriminately,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.33,0:02:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and nobody looked to save anyone else.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.24,0:02:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't resigned myself to the idea that that's how people are,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.34,0:03:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have been able to keep on living.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.60,0:03:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.95,0:03:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's precisely why I was inspired by his ideal.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.93,0:03:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.61,0:03:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Are these feelings fake just because they aren't my own?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.74,0:03:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I not achieve that ideal, just because it's fake?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.87,0:03:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.11,0:03:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that's not right.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.48,0:03:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if it's fake. Or an unattainable wish.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.63,0:03:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that I can't save everyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.31,0:03:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that no one can be saved without sacrifice!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.56,0:03:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Even knowing that it was nothing but an ideal,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.95,0:03:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I only chased after it even harder.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:42.86,0:03:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I hurt one to save many,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.90,0:03:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep pursuing a happy future where no one will be hurt.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.95,0:04:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is where that ideal ultimately lead him.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.12,0:04:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,A man once told me that what I believed in—\Nwhat I still believe in—was hypocrisy.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.12,0:04:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But in spite of that,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.34,0:04:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,the man who said those words \Nstayed true to that same hypocrisy to the end.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.64,0:04:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means that I can do it.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.63,0:04:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it's borrowed, even if it's fake, I don't care.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.74,0:04:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm okay with that.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.62,0:04:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Emiya Shirou can keep striving toward this dream!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.16,0:04:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,435)}Even if he doesn't find a single thing he was searching for!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.26,0:04:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.41,0:04:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all there was to it?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.28,0:04:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I may have held back, \NI'm sure you felt the blast of wind from Ea.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.98,0:04:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have all those weapons,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.47,0:04:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,why would you hold back just one?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.03,0:04:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the supreme ruler may wield that blade.{pv}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.20,0:05:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't the right to so much as look upon it.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.47,0:05:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Saber...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.07,0:05:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you unharmed, Shirou?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.50,0:05:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall take over from here.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.43,0:05:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you go help Tohsaka.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.07,0:05:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I can handle Gilgamesh by myself.{so cool}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.30,0:05:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying, Shirou?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.34,0:05:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A mage is no match for a Servant.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.18,0:05:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but he and I are exceptions to the rules.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.42,0:05:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.99,0:05:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I can beat this guy!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.22,0:05:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.72,0:05:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall keep Rin safe.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.24,0:05:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Saber...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.21,0:05:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't able to save you.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.52,0:06:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that Grail isn't what you were hoping for.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.67,0:06:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So take a good look.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.28,0:06:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,To make sure that you get it right next time.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.83,0:06:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Shirou?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.39,0:06:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it's hard to explain.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.29,0:06:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I was never cut out to be your Master.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.55,0:06:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.61,0:06:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That is untrue.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.85,0:06:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You are my Master, Shirou.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.88,0:06:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall go fulfill my duty as a Servant.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.89,0:06:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us continue our discussion afterward.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.86,0:06:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you mad, boy?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.29,0:06:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You choose to be the sacrificial pawn, rather than use Saber?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.87,0:07:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.52,0:07:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The act of self-sacrifice is naught but a lie.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.03,0:07:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Being unable to see that, even now,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.25,0:07:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,marks you as an incorrigible hypocrite.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.38,0:07:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,A fraud and a hypocrite, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.01,0:07:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess. I am a fake through and through, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.89,0:07:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But I was mistaken all along.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.98,0:07:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,My sword-making doesn't actually create them.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.74,0:07:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one thing that I can do.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.02,0:07:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's to give form to what's in my mind.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.86,0:07:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am the bone of my sword!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.51,0:07:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My whole life was Unlimited Blade Works!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.33,0:08:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. I don't create swords.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.43,0:08:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I create a world that contains an unlimited number of swords.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.23,0:08:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the only magic allowed to Emiya Shirou.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.62,0:08:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,A Reality Marble, eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.69,0:08:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What of it?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.14,0:08:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What can you do with this wretched mental landscape?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.09,0:08:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so surprised.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.16,0:08:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything here is a fake.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.64,0:08:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,However, there's nothing that says a fake can't rival the real thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.88,0:08:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say you're the genuine article,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.41,0:08:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,then I'll just surpass everything about you and take you down.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.52,0:08:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Aqui vou eu, Rei dos Heróis.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.44,0:08:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Você tem armas suficientes em estoque?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.54,0:09:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Você se acha importante demais, seu mestiço.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.31,0:09:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world is that?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.78,0:09:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Can being summoned incorrectly change a Servant so drastically?{pv}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.75,0:09:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Rin!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.74,0:09:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Rin?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.30,0:09:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Saber?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.45,0:09:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Rin!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.22,0:09:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Saber!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.83,0:09:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.03,0:09:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me. Just don't.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.58,0:09:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This muck is similar to a Servant in nature.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.11,0:09:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If you touched it, there's no telling what would happen.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.76,0:09:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.20,0:09:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Then hurry to this side, Rin.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.65,0:09:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you can get clear, I shall see to the rest.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.23,0:09:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Okay, I'll leave it to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.61,0:09:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I don't get there in time, do what has to be done.{pv}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.75,0:09:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot, Rin!{stutter?}{stuttering "I" never looks good so meh}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.95,0:09:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If that is the alternative, I shall rescue you now!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.28,0:09:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,These curses are...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.85,0:09:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Rin! You used a Command Spell?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.86,0:09:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I did.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.45,0:10:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let the one person who can \Ndestroy the Grail throw her life away.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.10,0:10:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, you don't need to worry about me.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.74,0:10:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I can get out of this, no problem.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.64,0:10:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't worry about that. \NJust believe in me and ready your holy sword.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.08,0:10:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Rin...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.27,0:10:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If only.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.27,0:10:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is definitely easier said than done.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.40,0:10:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if this thing would let me go if I returned Shinji.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.27,0:10:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.77,0:10:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.71,0:10:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Rin!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.50,0:10:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.75,0:11:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que as lâminas desse vira-lata estão me encurralando?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.33,0:11:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.34,0:11:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You may be ranked the highest of all Heroic Spirits
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.14,0:11:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,because you possess over a thousand Noble Phantasms.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.74,0:11:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're a king, not a warrior.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.94,0:11:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't choose the path of mastering a single Noble Phantasm.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.37,0:11:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're like me: jack of all trades, master of none!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.12,0:11:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Quando eu terminar com você, não sobrará um único estilhaço de osso do seu crânio falsificador!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.60,0:11:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the pits.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.71,0:11:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even tell which way to go to get out of here.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.39,0:12:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That jerk sure is using up my mana.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.55,0:12:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it, I guess.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.72,0:12:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't let it end like this.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.90,0:12:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,By my Command Spell, I order you:
Dialogue: 10,0:12:18.73,0:12:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Saber, destroy the Holy Grail right now!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.19,0:12:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Impossible!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.67,0:12:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Rin! Get out of there!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.24,0:12:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Saber.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:31.04,0:12:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You probably wouldn't do it if I just asked you, so I have to force you.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.50,0:12:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And I guess I should apologize to you too.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.32,0:12:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry I couldn't save you, Shinji.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:44.31,0:12:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Your pathetic whining offends me.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.24,0:13:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go, Rin.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.37,0:13:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Rin!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:28.33,0:13:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Saber!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.78,0:13:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm feeding you the last of my mana!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.22,0:13:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So take that Holy Grail
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.27,0:13:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,and blast it so hard
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.60,0:13:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,there won't be a single trace left!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:56.93,0:13:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ex...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.13,0:14:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,calibur!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.43,0:14:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.05,0:14:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Our contract is concluded.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.65,0:14:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory is yours, Rin.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.99,0:14:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Were it allowed, I would have liked to have remained to the end
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.78,0:15:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,to see what becomes of you two.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.73,0:15:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,However, that is not my role.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.12,0:15:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, Shirou has you, Rin.{;_;7}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.02,0:15:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.34,0:15:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm being forced back?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.10,0:15:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,By a fraud like you?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.18,0:15:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Against any other Servant,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.62,0:15:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,creating a world like this wouldn't let me hold my own.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.93,0:15:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Having an unlimited number of swords
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.20,0:15:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,wouldn't let me stand up to a Servant who had mastered one!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:47.44,0:15:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But against you,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.52,0:15:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,my swords are ready and waiting,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.32,0:15:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'm always one step ahead!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.59,0:15:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Damn you...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.74,0:15:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.82,0:16:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you! Damn you!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.06,0:16:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.26,0:16:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.46,0:16:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,To think that I must go all-out against the likes of you!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.22,0:16:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Rho Aias.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:13.90,0:17:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall grant you this:
Dialogue: 10,0:17:15.78,0:17:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,at this moment, you are powerful!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.66,0:17:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:54.00,0:17:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You ran out of mana? How anticlimactic.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.53,0:17:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory is yours.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:59.53,0:18:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Morra com essa satisfação, seu impostor.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:11.75,0:18:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.79,0:18:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Swallowing me accomplishes nothing...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.29,0:18:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.49,0:18:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The Holy Grail's hole?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.97,0:18:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That malformed abomination!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.42,0:18:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it not know that a fellow Servant cannot be made its core?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.48,0:18:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.88,0:18:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trying to take me down with you?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.82,0:18:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.17,0:18:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't the least intention of dying!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:39.65,0:18:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Plant your heels, ruffian!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:41.78,0:18:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,At least until I climb back to where you are!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.60,0:18:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,As if!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.38,0:18:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll rip off my own arm if that's what it takes!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.85,0:18:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Do so if you wish, but step to the right first.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.76,0:19:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You—
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.81,0:19:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ar... cher...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.77,0:19:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.65,0:19:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Always showing off.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:36.75,0:19:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Archer!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.33,0:19:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Archer...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.77,0:19:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's unfortunate,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.95,0:19:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,but there you have it.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.65,0:19:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Give up on the Grail this time, Rin.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:04.21,0:20:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with that?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.65,0:20:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is hardly the time to be laughing!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:08.68,0:20:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.08,0:20:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't help it, given your state.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.61,0:20:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I was amused that you and I cut such sorry figures.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:20.23,0:20:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Archer... Will you make a contract with me again?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.49,0:20:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do that.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.48,0:20:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt I have that right.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.81,0:20:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, I no longer have a goal.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:34.71,0:20:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My battle ends here.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.08,0:20:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But... But this means you'll...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.84,0:20:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how much time passes, you'll never be saved.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.12,0:20:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.71,0:20:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Rin.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.05,0:20:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Look after me.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.96,0:20:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,As you know, I'm a bit hopeless.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.94,0:20:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a shoulder to lean on.{funny what difference a hairstyle makes}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.29,0:21:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Archer...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.44,0:21:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.39,0:21:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.34,0:21:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try my hardest to make sure \Nhe doesn't end up a twisted jerk like you.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.46,0:21:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure he learns to love himself!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:16.35,0:21:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So you hang in there too!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:19.56,0:21:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I have my answer.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:22.16,0:21:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Tohsaka.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:25.22,0:21:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try my hardest from now on, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:40.11,0:21:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, I didn't even get the chance to tear him a new one.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:50.45,0:21:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go home, Tohsaka.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.78,0:07:37.78,Default-Italic,,0,0,0,,Steel is my body and fire is my blood
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.40,0:07:40.79,Default-Italic,,0,0,0,,I have created over a thousand blades
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.20,0:07:43.04,Default-Italic,,0,0,0,,Unaware of Loss,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.23,0:07:45.17,Default-Italic,,0,0,0,,nor aware of Gain
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.77,0:07:47.67,Default-Italic,,0,0,0,,Withstood pain to create weapons,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.10,0:07:50.42,Default-Italic,,0,0,0,,waiting for one’s arrival
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.81,0:07:54.17,Default-Italic,,0,0,0,,I have no regrets. This is the only path
