Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.08,0:00:33.75,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Ocultos na minha mão esquerda
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.75,0:00:36.97,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Meus desejos permanecem não realizados
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.97,0:00:41.68,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,880)\blur7.5}Presos em um sonho sem fim
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.13,0:00:44.97,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Ocultas na minha mão direita
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.97,0:00:48.18,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Minhas memórias vazias continuam invisíveis a todos
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.18,0:00:53.90,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Sendo açoitadas por uma chuva sem fim
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.90,0:01:00.05,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,540)\blur7.5}Seja a força para proteger o que é precioso
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.28,0:01:04.55,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Ou a fraqueza de perder a fé nisso
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.55,0:01:07.22,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,280)\blur7.5}Aceitarei tudo isso
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.49,0:01:09.99,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,480)\blur7.5}E buscarei um novo amanhecer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.75,0:01:18.36,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,780)\blur7.5}If I reach out, I can stay in this night
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.36,0:01:23.61,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,780)\blur7.5}Mesmo em farrapos, você salva a minha vida
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.76,0:01:27.43,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur7.5}The tip of the blade held high
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.43,0:01:29.93,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}And all the feelings held inside
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.93,0:01:37.38,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(290,1080)\blur7.5}Uma prece que transcende o tempo
