Dialogue: 2,0:22:51.74,0:23:00.02,edeng,,0,0,0,,{\c&H632355&\3c&H120405&\t(2015,3016,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&)\t(3048,3048,1,\c&HFEFBE5&\3c&H1A0602&)\blur0.75}Com sonhos em nossos corações
Dialogue: 2,0:23:00.03,0:23:04.24,edeng,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\c&HFDF4FF&\fad(0,200)}Certa vez você chorou na noite
Dialogue: 2,0:23:04.24,0:23:12.45,edeng,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\c&HFDF4FF&\3c&H642C08&\fad(200,200)}Mas um futuro melhor sempre foi possível para nós
Dialogue: 2,0:23:12.45,0:23:17.02,edeng,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\c&HFDF4FF&\3c&H642C08&\fad(200,200)}A quietude espera por você
Dialogue: 2,0:23:17.02,0:23:23.30,edeng,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\c&HFDF4FF&\3c&H642C08&\fad(200,0)}Podemos encontrar aquela colina resplandecente
Dialogue: 2,0:23:23.30,0:23:28.91,edeng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur0.75\c&HFDF4FF&\3c&H642C08&}Ring your bell
